proofs are those of std::mutable_array::at. For affine elements the
displaced element is released.

== EXAMPLES
@example accept
import std::mutable_array

a = std::mutable_array::create(2, "")
a.set(1, "hi")
a.freeze(2)
@value ["", "hi"]
@end

