== DESCRIPTION
The suite: the context a program installs. Its one field is the registered
cases, in registration order. Exactly two functions declare it as their
context parameter -- `case` (registration) and `registered` (the snapshot
the runner reads) -- and every other function's requirement is derived: a
context implements, structurally, any context trait whose operations its
owner's functions with that context parameter spell (CONTEXT-TRAITS.md), so
the fewer such functions, the fewer application traits the suite could
